{"id":"00393","root":"uni00393_1","name":{"ja":"石川　あむ","en":"Ishikawa Amu"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"石川　あむ","en":"Ishikawa Amu"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-10-31","limited":true,"characterId":243,"profile":{"ja":"希少な忍法、石遁の術“路傍石”を操る対魔忍。ふうま一門に仕える下忍の出身で、学校では主人公の後輩にあたる。“路傍石”は、まるで道端の単なる小石の様に自分を認識させる、つまり完全に存在感を消してしまう忍法で、ひとたび発動すれば彼女が泣こうが叫ぼうが敵に存在を察知される事はない。人見知りで恥ずかしがり屋な性格もあり、忍法を使うまでもなく存在感がないとも言われる。その存在感のなさと、誰にも気付かれない努力と根性を対魔忍ライブラリーに認められ、隊長とするふうま宗家御庭番の壱番隊筆頭に抜擢された。ただ、何か落ち込むような事が発生すると自らダメ人間になろうとする悪癖があり、ギャンブルに有り金をつぎ込もうとする、夏休み最終日に宿題をしようとするなど、彼女の考えうる限りのダメ人間行動をとろうとする。","en":"Ishikawa Amu is a Taimanin who wields the rare ninjutsu \"Roadside Stone,\" a stone-throwing technique. Born as a low-rank ninja serving the Fuuma clan, she is a junior to the protagonist at the academy. \"Roadside Stone\" makes her blend into the surroundings as if she were just a pebble on the road, completely erasing her presence; once activated, no matter how she cries or shouts, enemies cannot detect her. She's shy and self-conscious, often said to have no presence even without using ninjutsu. Her lack of presence and her unnoticed perseverance earned her recognition from the Taimanin Library, and she was appointed leader of the first squad of the Fuuma family's elite guard. However, when something brings her down, she has a bad habit of trying to become a \"worthless person\" herself—throwing money at gambling, attempting homework on the last day of summer break, and generally indulging in every self-destructive behavior she can think of."},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"立花沙羅","forms":[{"id":"uni00393_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[916,1832],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[151,302],"def":[131,262],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","820001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",5],["evo00011",15],["evo00012",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00393_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1332,2664],"sp":[220,220],"atk":[237,474],"def":[197,394],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","820001","820002"],"evolve":[["evo00011",10],["evo00012",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00393_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[1748,3502],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[328,658],"def":[268,535],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","820001","820002","820003"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage","tag":"instant"}]},"820001":{"slot":"skill1","id":820001,"name":{"ja":"岩盤浴"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"自身のHPを大回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Self: restore 40% HP","icon":"Healing_hp","tag":"instant"}]},"820002":{"slot":"skill2","id":820002,"name":{"ja":"御影石"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":220,"detail":{"ja":"２ターンの間、自身が敵から非常に狙われにくくなる"}},{"level":2,"sp":215,"detail":{"ja":"２ターンの間、自身が敵から非常に狙われにくくなる"}},{"level":3,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"２ターンの間、自身が敵から非常に狙われにくくなる"}},{"level":4,"sp":205,"detail":{"ja":"２ターンの間、自身が敵から非常に狙われにくくなる"}},{"level":5,"sp":200,"detail":{"ja":"２ターンの間、自身が敵から非常に狙われにくくなる"}}],"effects":[{"text":"Self: harder to target 80% for 2 turns","tag":"state","stack":"target"}]},"820003":{"slot":"ultimate","id":820003,"name":{"ja":"石遁の術・路傍石"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する（自身の残りHPが高いほど威力がアップ）"}},{"level":2,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する（自身の残りHPが高いほど威力がアップ）"}},{"level":3,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する（自身の残りHPが高いほど威力がアップ）"}},{"level":4,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する（自身の残りHPが高いほど威力がアップ）"}},{"level":5,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃する（自身の残りHPが高いほど威力がアップ）"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 620% at 0 HP to 820% at full HP (own HP) Natural damage","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"御庭番壱番隊筆頭"},"detail":{"ja":"自身を除く部隊全体のDEFを大アップ+自身が敵から狙われにくくなる"},"effects":[{"text":"Allies other than self: DEF +20%","tag":"passive"},{"text":"Self: harder for enemies to target (-50%)","icon":"target_down","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00002",80],[1,"blo00006",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00002",160],[12,"blo00006",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00002",80],[26,"blo00006",1],[27,"blo00008",3],[27,"blo00011",3],[27,"blo00014",3],[28,"blo00008",3],[28,"blo00011",3],[28,"blo00014",3],[29,"blo00008",3],[29,"blo00011",3],[29,"blo00014",3],[30,"blo00008",3],[30,"blo00011",3],[30,"blo00014",3],[31,"blo00002",160],[31,"blo00006",2],[32,"blo00008",3],[32,"blo00011",3],[32,"blo00014",3],[33,"blo00008",3],[33,"blo00011",3],[33,"blo00014",3],[34,"blo00008",3],[34,"blo00011",3],[34,"blo00014",3],[35,"blo00008",3],[35,"blo00011",3],[35,"blo00014",3],[36,"blo00002",160],[36,"blo00006",2],[37,"blo00008",3],[37,"blo00011",3],[37,"blo00014",3],[38,"blo00008",3],[38,"blo00011",3],[38,"blo00014",3],[39,"blo00008",3],[39,"blo00011",3],[39,"blo00014",3],[40,"blo00008",3],[40,"blo00011",3],[40,"blo00014",3],[41,"blo00002",160],[41,"blo00006",2],[42,"blo00008",3],[42,"blo00011",3],[42,"blo00014",3],[43,"blo00008",3],[43,"blo00011",3],[43,"blo00014",3],[44,"blo00008",3],[44,"blo00011",3],[44,"blo00014",3],[45,"blo00008",3],[45,"blo00011",3],[45,"blo00014",3],[46,"blo00002",160],[46,"blo00006",2],[47,"blo00008",3],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ふうま宗家御庭番・壱番隊筆頭を拝命いたしました、石川あむです。お館様の護衛は私にお任せください","en":"I've been appointed as the leader of the Fuuma family's elite guard, Ishikawa Amu. Please leave Master's protection to me."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ふむふむ……お館様はこの時間にお風呂に。だらけて、おトイレに行かれおやすみに。おや、お布団がもぞもぞと？　ふむふむ","en":"Hmm, hmm... Master is taking a bath at this hour. Then, Master will get ready for bed after using the restroom. Oh, the bed is creaking?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"お館様～、うふふ。お～や～か～た～さ～ま～、えへへ～","en":"Master~, hehe. Oh, Master~, ahahah~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"はい、私はここにいますよ。常に、いついかなる時も、どんな場所でも、私はお館様のお側に","en":"Yes, I'm always here. At all times, no matter the place, I'm by Master's side."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"お～や～か～た～さ～ま～、うふふ～……うおぉおええっ、忍法使うの忘れてました！？","en":"Oh, Master~, hehe... Oh no, I forgot to use my ninjutsu!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"お風呂でもおトイレでも。姿は見えませんのでご安心くださいね","en":"Even in the bath or the restroom, you don't have to worry since I'm invisible."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"存在が消えても私はいますよ、お館様をお守りするために","en":"Even if my presence disappears, I'm still here to protect Master."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"あああぁ～、私みたいなだめ人間は飲む打つ買って地獄に落ちるのがお似合いなんですっ！","en":"Ahhh, someone like me, a useless person, deserves to drink, gamble, and fall into hell!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ああぁぁ……私なんてことをしているんでしょう、裸で、こんな格好で……これじゃまるで……んんっ！","en":"Ahhh... What am I doing, being naked and dressed like this... It's just like..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00393_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"はあ、はあ、お館様ぁ、私、こんな格好でお側にいるんですよ？","en":"Haa, haa, Master, I'm by your side like this."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00393_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"だ、だめぇっ、ふあっ、ああぁあっ、裸でいるの、癖になっちゃいますぅ……！","en":"No, no, ahahah, being naked is becoming a habit..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00393_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00393_1/uni00393_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100,200],"scenes":[["chr_0269_1_r18"],["chr_0269_2_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0269_1a_r18"],["chr_0269_2a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"event","type":"Map event","title":{"ja":"Map event #17","en":"Map event #17"},"archive":true},{"kind":"mission","title":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00393","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00393_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0269"}}